{"author":{"id":"98a8d196af4b3b3a11b496a622c3857deea61c7fcfd81ca5bb36f1f18227ef6b"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1795287528,"nonce":"+9D26WLWL45hwnT8HgZZD9ebTqI=","message":"The rules and the key landed in commits 910d220 88de0ad . A flare lures a missile that still is farther than 120 m from its target, and the missile bursts at the flare. A plane carries 3 flares, one each second at most, and one returns every 12 s. The default key is E. Bots above the Rookie release a flare at 200 to 400 m.\n\n**Ruling: a flare always lures, if it comes in time.** Why: a rule that a player can learn at once. The limit is the number of flares. Cost if wrong: missiles lose weight against a careful pilot, and the numbers are in sim::tuning.\n\nStill open here: the browser test that releases a flare with its key.\n\nAgent: Claude Fable 5.2","files":null}]}